  "title": "Section 3: Ineligible and Restricted Industries",
  "content": "Section 3: Ineligible and Restricted Industries\nUnder federal compliance and internal risk guidelines, Darwix strictly prohibits funding to businesses engaged in:\n- Gambling operations, casinos, sports betting, and lottery ventures.\n- Adult entertainment venues or novelty businesses.\n- Cannabis, marijuana cultivation, or dispensaries.\n- Cryptocurrency trading, speculative token mining, or crypto futures.\n- Predatory payday lending or debt settlement organizations.",
